# Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored) and fill in real values.
#
# Usage (loads vars into shell, then runs a script):
#   set -a; source g2g/.env; set +a
#   node g2g/create_offer_internal.js
#
# Or inline for a single command:
#   G2G_JWT=$(cat g2g/.env | grep G2G_JWT | cut -d= -f2-) node g2g/lookup_offer.js G1234567890XX

# JWT bearer token from your logged-in g2g.com browser session.
# How to get it:
#   1. Log in to https://www.g2g.com/
#   2. DevTools -> Network -> filter "sls.g2g.com"
#   3. Trigger any action (e.g. open your offers page)
#   4. Click any sls.g2g.com XHR -> Headers -> copy the full "authorization" value
# Lives ~15 min per token; refresh when expired (sls.g2g.com responds 401).
